### Completar compra
POST http://localhost:3200/api/purchase/complete-purchase
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "purchaseId": 1
}

### Eliminar una compra

POST http://localhost:3200/api/purchase/reject-purchase
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "purchaseId": 2
}

###
# token del cajero
@token = token

### Compra en POS
POST http://localhost:3200/api/purchase/pos-purchase
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Barer {{token}}

{
    "basicUserData": {
        "email": "a@a.com",
        "name": "james",
        "docType": "CC",
        "identification": "123456789012345",
        "telephone": "11"
    },
    "productList": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "quantity": 3
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "quantity": 3
        }
    ],
    "locationId": 1
}